# 13. RPC and microservices

RPC became especially important with microservices.

Imagine an e-commerce system:

```text
                    API Gateway
                         │
          ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐
          ↓              ↓              ↓
      User Service   Order Service   Product Service
                         │
                         ↓
                   Payment Service
```

Services need to communicate.

Possible communication styles:

```text
REST
gRPC
Message Queue
Events
```

For synchronous service-to-service calls:

```text
Order Service
      │
      │ gRPC
      ↓
Payment Service
```

For asynchronous communication:

```text
Order Service
      │
      │ OrderCreated
      ↓
Kafka / RabbitMQ
      │
      ├──→ Inventory
      ├──→ Email
      └──→ Analytics
```

So RPC is one piece of the larger **distributed-systems communication toolbox**.

